{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1191,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42262c829a6adc314f99d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜啊～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b712a8e8f4e409107c091e6e325705933f1495d4dc44c36697dba39829476b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:148a66f3a888ee76bcb33550",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天似乎能\r\n拿到这个呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ffb6e9df40d053b3a8835789d23d7d71698f39bea8db3c7568149645abdf2d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049acc2a7a883aeae5f809f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…感觉身体稍微有点沉～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b550dbfe192077b97f7cc998db3a495277853694c2d4e348ebcc195c6838c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f3262c329a76f172df6844a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员～…不好意思，\r\n能让我稍微休息一下吗～…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1449c3358912aa02cd7937d3ffdaee6d7a2c936f73c2c7e78b06b9da9c768802",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e280513f08227d5bf966ef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦哦…！\r\n现在的我感觉什么都做得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cabceddf6ba125abcb1d84cf1f607065bbef5b12f9731f7ca2e2a2f99351b498",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363f4d2b43e79adc59247453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想跑起来好想跑起来，\r\n内心躁动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7745f80510ba30adafcb89acc60b96164e5d8b5beafb1a903ea19dfd0fb5d2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0d840fa976a04a66afda997",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉状态不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc3c489fbe564c283c36ca13b76a88724cba6064f1b28aece2842e6a226a9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664238818f07a2b2f32d900e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n那么接下来怎么做呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab01ebfc25361cbdf78f0dc15c04051a4159b6f9abdff4cf277d03b174772cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d562870b222fd7776bba3355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好ー，\r\n训练要加油了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d2ed876732b14672e2fd2db92f4e2b5d39f89bad561a4b74fac4e490c5cc27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a289cd05deab6557d6f4529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练清单怎么安排呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bbb2df7810dccf259c0f8c11179b1d626976d898f5eabdbc566f0008f5c5f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9b4f6cb056d75eb27ab96c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯ー…\r\n感觉稍微有点使不上劲…",
      "source_fingerprint": "58fe1e5aa84896bff3c7a136dee51c206f23c3b8c3c5ec657d71161e6dabe17d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3afc8ddc9b89d19a40265041",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…啊，对不起。\r\n稍微有点打不起精神…",
      "source_fingerprint": "95519d64061668be0f60924627e8f5aa713754700b9103383a24af3335082322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee1537dcb22fc71746d9b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，身体使不上力气～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4c7876d763517062b06a78a14ff581b6442a1f671fc1b390bbc3f93c4b582b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db18b4e5ce3e874feebf8b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脑子里尽想着些不好的事情…\r\n哈啊～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "50fd57dbd7ab92d93f6b5dff1aaa59e6525ca3cbc6ec14360fa32905344f3d32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889d5e071d643544533b8ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次的比赛也要参加吗…？\r\n稍微感觉量有点太多了什么的…\r\n不不，我还是会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b2a0baafdde8e0f256adf19b22ebe38f47919cd2ff746773fc2a195a62f085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2cc8e75aedab9eb0f337c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，那个～…能不参加这次的比赛，\r\n让我休息一下吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0247665d4364e3fd99589b572e9180a17e10f7af181fbcf3e94369c0b81cc39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fc9598164636d991cc5a567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快一点快一点，我想快点开始比赛！\r\n现在的我可以尽情地发挥实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9b0c8d0423f1f7a40e944ab2c46563f3a45dbb7282d42c39474fa29fdc6d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1acdab413cdc45fb4ca43afd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态已调整到绝佳！\r\n剩下的就是在实战中赢下比赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f045f15d21a9bfa4951133383b0e142c6538faea57c5e023903e6577b7a5858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:674e3129f3c3f9f46c655f8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着日本第一的梦想，\r\n全力飞奔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af55c5585174cceeb370af6f3ee40ed3c7f8a5637220df453046916b604f07a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963d2cea8da80655d8e99515",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，感觉不错！\r\n我会以达成目标为目的加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b22ee95cdb54b1d7dbb8bc78ca7bc7b9f332727a3465c7974c684b00f8aa986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b22c77c1e27bc07c2ea634e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，身体感觉好轻快！\r\n能发挥出比平时更强的实力也说不定…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a73ee1d82c769a8e4b7e8a9cdd30040242c888141056bbd1c2c4fcb220a365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0dbe99cd1c266486781950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是重要的比赛，\r\n所以要好好加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f90f1b01cabb6872b897d43c1b057d7ee341220d917be1554ed4fa01f31fde5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af32988d43e83a7471496138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于到了比赛的时候呢。\r\n我会以第1名为目标加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "291bee95a8f578ccb16ee6ce58ffb5c54cd11d5206b8ec1346a36f4da62141c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6129251daaa27b0e8b2230ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静下来，为了能像往常一样\r\n发挥实力，\r\n我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade50846be2cc0f00e1430c3504d74237bddee9f2c7bfa06c6c99e08ce77ba87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2b7c04010aa01b1b0edafe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开、开始紧张了…\r\n深呼吸、深呼吸…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2d0276fc9cafbba6d9fe3b5901a23d46c6b721b60678b9855fc74d827a771b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c54ac4b2da96452fb03cdf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题的、没问题的…！\r\n总、总之我会\r\n尽情奔跑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1167bec03c33ae1a9c537afe47dae8f74a14d1b4db54987b6cfa0f596a704b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2952a66adc5ac3d6862994e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉气势不足～…！\r\n能帮忙拍一下我的后背，给我鼓鼓劲吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c032d190cfed6456e899a31ac9fd0c430d023840cecbf21532edd587585ee57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29fdd35aa57546b477e080d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能说泄气话呢。\r\n不努力的话…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "137c0574a9c05e9781960ac3ada1707861ef5bda2d6ecfd84e2a00363444ebaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6880fe2bd8f439172ea81e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家看起来都好强的样子…\r\n但、但是我也会尽力而为的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b09d731225541976ea1040462bdb4ffd1d1a738b3f345189dd618051107a6d0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14057355ba99cdd3c14dacef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能再努力调整一下状态就好了～。\r\n总、总之我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c65326b0963056af1df24698d74139af4b66cbe9811064ddcc01ad82f3d68b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e0d1eb7b026f776f0145253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能赢吗…\r\n呜呜、不能打退堂鼓…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f75360a3878ff410f7b11e18975191ef4e66f715b83dbd3dfe935a6ad6f208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478f075290dca399ecfcb730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74943f67fdb6bec707ec5e6387cdfec8caec07d1c68c02caa8a577731d658a27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247b1990120812b170fb1b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001bcdeef696cb4ba0a13681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc34ef3772cf869c0ad541b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中、集中…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14930f038192bd52f9b3d62b4ecb66d90442913969fb691141ac818b6de140b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd60becd40711247514c3dfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊嘞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53393e71d4c30f397f5ff6e3d6599b5ea7167b3de4a75f785bbe3669c155704f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27fe6039ee42c4b8672f3964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c1006da88249698a22b67f1d9fc5da3573185c190621ec7839b42dc3f704242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2b4808f3159babe52828ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f2d6a4443e24d89a427855b93350f9248edf76d3376d57af4074a8054b0095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aef1e44726ea3587ce5cc157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是大海～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "281a24b2ee05acea2fac7a4bd0ccdf2650fa75c9b210b3ca1b8d50bbe742b3c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197cb51697d9f49cb4f93b90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了训练员，我才能够成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "352a3e6eabb4ff04ac8167409aed863a0a905b5e568fe94df493306b5f8f2b85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc0c66e14064989cd7ea68c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ed3b0b9ec34444ea0647c13bff1574415b95ac40788b298e4a30e187585599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd3f29796dbeec6ebb4ce02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持不懈地加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f618d0dc8b39dfbb4c564a1a54cf48ef55bb789dfe9ec2b891bf3749ace6c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2112a3d55dc97e38ec140d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f86abb17829372e7e16b5175f1320ff3667ae47d982c2178ff5001aa3e3c70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0bba19a22bf5c4e84b301f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，一起加油吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09540cfb48ca3d09cb5e3962ff5a096fd2679aaa393a020e57a2efcc984bb9a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ab951b381dbf77ede494e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ed3b0b9ec34444ea0647c13bff1574415b95ac40788b298e4a30e187585599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4c5f71519c861f9b1c475b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是重要的比赛，\r\n所以要好好加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f90f1b01cabb6872b897d43c1b057d7ee341220d917be1554ed4fa01f31fde5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a298a9480f17ced8e052afe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着日本第一的梦想，\r\n全力飞奔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af55c5585174cceeb370af6f3ee40ed3c7f8a5637220df453046916b604f07a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7444c6632d248783557d6fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ed3b0b9ec34444ea0647c13bff1574415b95ac40788b298e4a30e187585599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf66f68ef12d343fc6979144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "がんばります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf2ebe2e4a91f296de7073d2e3b6c30949c84adbbb12fbfa83a3dd144e3989e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf75d241e547104e02b51d42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然与第1名失之交臂…但我还是很高兴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2dea98fed244ed7cb106f89e54ba92f4cf314e40efc72da9b677477dee73dba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11fdc1f5824a5cc644b424c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离第1名还差一点…不努力的话可不行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e48d34f7880d554d35b473d1e2f627e026d3dea205115a6913dfa2837b7d5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce1ba5064a4900132edee5c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我想跑的更好…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca105e59a9af045cdfa9910e8e9c6dd8a4a965ce05faa68800088e1f9387801a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f818412949981aba9b7449a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜呜～搞砸了～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c845921b96bdf1c08e62a8b9018defb07f75d794b6fdae25f47eddcda6f1c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d4de6cbe055797557bba3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！太好了～！我是第1名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4624313aa7c1262fb0606ba903fb9abcfb56842dd5012b95a61df675eb89354b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954a410a0fb909bd283a4098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，非常感谢！下场比赛我也会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99899961abcac4573040e77dce1670511a6b546ac255216c5ee5b7249e58d1ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad4ceb55cfebfb35f2b5bea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场盛夏的激战呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9006ede2475aaedb810fc0a6cd05f1ac6362228a7fa9afefb97bc8c3814a89f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef79f078cf25e9592bd20ff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，非常感谢！下场比赛我也会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99899961abcac4573040e77dce1670511a6b546ac255216c5ee5b7249e58d1ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8553db7bfd7b83fb4dddf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在是……全日本最幸福的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d18971892d84390e1385c8d4a2a7b3158dd53bf67112a26e3e768ffff06bfbdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb7ad2b6aecf2502144b200",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，非常感谢！下场比赛我也会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99899961abcac4573040e77dce1670511a6b546ac255216c5ee5b7249e58d1ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7eb9f69e565b7f0f3c03c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "685c098711a27a637f325eabde144ab41f542d4c61533aa66ba1b9b4e40e6819",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ae7faaf787313ff30c19adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着梦想全速奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "449f2ad1b3ae2580f5b9359829821e1d0d15e9381209c03a5d619d3d9b798fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:832b0c24b5b6b7e89f7b5556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的转学考试，\r\n难度真高啊～…\r\n直到现在都不敢相信自己考过了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b96531c10f48f832636d102dd04926d1211484be303eb898802b89c1699ada85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a61469becabc63f74fb45bcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被马娘们包围也好，\r\n和同龄人们共同生活也好…\r\n第一次的事情太多了啊～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77af738426a449e3a7d0fa45475a3904d63b191be7be944fd7b5b5bd58d3ce59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941564bf024dc5b7de592526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的食堂里我最喜欢的菜，\r\n已经做好了…诶嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5822ddc2e69cdf88ee13d1b18ebb5d3e36e7c11d9c32d72c8a917b6fdd6f8d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a21b8cb8a4c7b4f2e724aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，给妈妈写信…\r\n还太早了呢。之前因为没习惯学园\r\n而被骂了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "86aaeb49308320d7159843ab064f3d8a6b2db9cb01382d5d003146de5dd0a06c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f38fa7c510cf130a68e391",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小草和小鹰，\r\n模拟赛的成绩好厉害…\r\n那两人，都很优秀啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c224a17016ea5d2ee364ffe8b708f63723635374bdda1a7d618b8154dff127",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ffc22dab84a420b99d58c1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…铃鹿同学，会不会觉得\r\n一个人住房间比较安静\r\n会更好呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f878931f5bee2480f71b947af1c33debd551997f2d13f3e098b1e3681d9fa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0080fb30cd470af8459c8ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…好。好好吃饭，\r\n好好睡觉…然后，我也…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58898b2ab0b2b2e390e62de8b72799ddddaf825a06185d0da793906881aca164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3805294c5472f3ac61f3bab2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王同学，小小的又\r\n活泼开朗…但是，\r\n真的是很帅啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "537629b32b5f41b2b1716ce0bae61b9b7de1c085fc59c83e20d4ebcd4a59d774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18ea8f99ccff751405c20a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…妈妈。\r\n我…感觉马上就能\r\n充满自信地去写信了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1bb20473e796e536df456d1905a84d5248f33dd7f7cffcbd8c7c70e77439d89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a59cebfb88e7387ef271321c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，马上就要到选拔赛了…！\r\n我会遇上什么样的\r\n训练员呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "339b31ed42bde086ec59d0c66e5c5d503536e9d2b3d57c44c5764284fe247226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0c5ebfdcecf7f652bedb93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊…哈啊～…好ー！请好好看着我哦，妈妈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c317be510e9568236f4663b97bf4f3d57bed17be9ab0a6b412b77fe0f9cff22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413c1fa943b8b64ff366d260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下个休息日，我要和铃鹿同学\r\n一起出去了！\r\n哇哇哇，去哪里好呢…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "855b5739399b2234bbf776310561f575f8aae01e0247467fe6b646872c36c385",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3c92a3b8c461024f3a5bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小鹰和小草，邀请我\r\n参加放学后的特训…！\r\n嗯…好，加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e9e9a5800c9357b8865eccb914e7cc0c3c5e15de0710fa3236ba498b090683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbaa99d68a0aee80a566145",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动虽然已经结束了…\r\n但现在是时候开始，\r\n向着梦想奔跑了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367097eb4d96694cf7ba1f6c73c17c3ef35b57561cf727bd4a81b4c4b11d33b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b39b42d6ae8ea2c995ad01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀！？至今为止，\r\n我是怎么跑的来着！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "053da5e839a15966c8e9067799bc4af339e7ad93cc8ee65cbd7332f0e0c991d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2b586a6e0780c41c5ed98e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我决定了。\r\n我…要认真地去玩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6efa43bec8e3230b6f3720d897569a27d003562ab455cf6c7b1d6269b0d0bab5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4607893f904b7cd857d9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶！妈妈也去过\r\n泡沫乐园的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e88f1478b3a689f0c70eb27120d60ff6dcd323df5185b5535c8f118cae30c57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8424db7e81cbf5d4984a4cd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可能是因为练习开心吧，\r\n每天的饭都很好吃！\r\n一不小心就吃多了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e60e8b3cda2179a819a81fbfad4e98c55ab72badaa3ba42e8b95f7a82a457e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "400026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f493888b735285078f3838f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创造出难以忘怀的回忆吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f94f6a1fb8458b7023dd383a99193b5acb4955ec3cbd6a3059a36e22702b7c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "40003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
